### Create Staking Pool (via Admin Service)
### Pool types: FIXED_1_MONTH, FIXED_3_MONTHS, FIXED_6_MONTHS, FIXED_12_MONTHS, FLEXIBLE
POST http://localhost:28080/api/admin/orchestration/staking/tiers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "poolName": "Testing Pool",
  "poolType": "FIXED_1_MONTH",
  "minStakeAmount": 100.0,
  "maxStakeAmount": 10000.0,
  "lockPeriodDays": 30,
  "apyPercentage": 5.00,
  "boostMultiplier": 1.2,
  "isActive": true,
  "description": "Fixed staking pool for 1 month with 5% APY"
}

###

### Create Staking Pool with ID in path (ID is ignored)
POST http://localhost:28080/api/admin/orchestration/staking/tiers/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "poolName": "3 Months Fixed Pool",
  "poolType": "FIXED_3_MONTHS",
  "minStakeAmount": 500.0,
  "maxStakeAmount": 50000.0,
  "lockPeriodDays": 90,
  "apyPercentage": 8.00,
  "boostMultiplier": 1.5,
  "isActive": true,
  "description": "Fixed staking pool for 3 months with 8% APY"
}

###

### Create Flexible Staking Pool (no max amount, no lock period)
POST http://localhost:28080/api/admin/orchestration/staking/tiers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "poolName": "Flexible Staking Pool",
  "poolType": "FLEXIBLE",
  "minStakeAmount": 10.0,
  "maxStakeAmount": null,
  "lockPeriodDays": 0,
  "apyPercentage": 3.00,
  "boostMultiplier": 1.0,
  "isActive": true,
  "description": "Flexible staking pool with no lock period"
}

###

### Create Pool using Legacy Fields (backward compatibility)
POST http://localhost:28080/api/admin/orchestration/staking/tiers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tierName": "Legacy Pool Name",
  "poolType": "FIXED_6_MONTHS",
  "minStakeAmount": 1000.0,
  "maxStakeAmount": 100000.0,
  "lockPeriodDays": 180,
  "apyPercentage": 12.00,
  "apBoostPerHour": 2.0,
  "isActive": true,
  "description": "Pool created using legacy field names"
}

